    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d592">

                <pb facs="0570" n="398" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg398"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 835.6131/42</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-03T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 3, 1918, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your January 2, 4 p.m. You are authorized to send to Minister Foreign Affairs
                    note in the form and language quoted in your telegram above mentioned.</p>
                <pb facs="0571" n="399" xml:id="pg399"/>
                <p>It is understood by Department, from your telegram of December 29, 4 p.m.,<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d592-f1"/> that the word combustible refers to coal and not to
                    oil.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
